# Line placements of the drivetrain (bom.ttl) for the placements tests, in the shape the placements CONSTRUCT produces:
# each occurrence with its line, index, translations (quantity values in the site's unit) and rotations in degrees.
#   DE  de-gearbox > de-stage: 2, the second 100 mm up and turned 90 degrees about z; de-stage > de-gear: 3, 10 mm apart
#       along x; de-stage > de-bolt-kit (4) and de-kit > de-gearbox carry none
#   FR  fr-kit > fr-panel: 2; fr-cover-set (FR only) > fr-panel: 4 and > fr-hinge (FR only): 2
#   UK  uk-kit > uk-motor: 2, the second 10 in along x and turned 180 degrees about z
#   ES  es-frame > es-bracket: 2, the second turned 90 degrees about x
